        "TileImage": "$($repository bd0689d6-07b4-4757-b8ee-cac19f1c9e16).Image",
        "Description": "A recent operational review has concluded that the Burj Al-Ghazali hotel suffers from severe compliance issues: poor structural fastening overhead and lock of personal safety.\r\rMarcus Stuyvesant&apos;s lifelong pursuit of the high culture has finally caught up with him - literally from a high ceiling. Meanwhile, Carl Ingram has discovered that he was welcomed by an uninvited guest who perfers a more &apos;hands-on&apos; style.\r\rClient requests a discrete, bespoke touch. Happy hunting!",
